\subtree{
  \title{Decision}
  \p{Theory cannot directly import Kernel/, Root/, or Mathlib category theory and algebraic topology. Compiled statement and proof dependencies are audited; a source import grep is only a preliminary check. Tactics are allowed if their proof terms respect the boundary. Both stub and kernel-backed builds run on each merge candidate.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rationale}
  \p{Imports and tactics can introduce transitive dependencies.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rejected}
  \p{Treating a passing stub build as a consistency proof.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Acceptance}
  \p{\ref{at-fd-0002}, \ref{at-fd-0011}.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Status}
  \p{frozen policy.}
}
